  ('STA 204', 'Statistics for Agricultural and Biology Sciences II', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Biological Sciences', 'Biochemistry', '200 Level', 'second', 2, 'Tests of significance. Student $t$ test and $\chi^2$ test. Two sample test and paired comparison. Regression and correlation. Analysis of variance: one way, two way with no interaction. Latin square analysis. Multiple range tests. Analysis of covariance. Simple analysis of direct assays.', '["Tests of significance", "Student $t$ test and $\\chi^2$ test", "Two sample test and paired comparison", "Regression and correlation", "Analysis of variance: one way, two way with no interaction", "Latin square analysis", "Multiple range tests", "Analysis of covariance", "Simple analysis of direct assays"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Statistics handbook'),
  ('MCB 202', 'General Microbiology II', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Biological Sciences', 'Biochemistry', '200 Level', 'second', 3, 'Review of the structure and organisation of prokaryotic and eukaryotic cells. Principles and methodology of numerical taxonomy. Application of molecular biology in classification of microorganisms. Systematic classification of bacteria, fungi, protozoa and viruses. Physiology, ecology and laboratory identification of important species of microorganisms. Elemental cycles (carbon, nitrogen and phosphorus).

Pre-requisite: MCB 102', '["Structure and organisation of prokaryotic and eukaryotic cells", "Principles and methodology of numerical taxonomy", "Application of molecular biology in classification of microorganisms", "Systematic classification of bacteria, fungi, protozoa and viruses", "Physiology, ecology and laboratory identification of important species of microorganisms", "Elemental cycles: carbon, nitrogen and phosphorus"]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Biological Sciences course catalogue'),
